        "-->\n",
        "\n",
        "### Class codes and names\n",
        "\n",
        "Back to our land cover item. The class codes and names are stored in the metadata of the item's `data` asset:"
      ],
      "id": "f7eb7d45"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Class codes and names from the item's metadata\n",
        "class_values = item.assets['data'].extra_fields['file:values']\n",
        "class_values"
      ],
      "id": "8082ae9b",
      "execution_count": null,
